// Clue - ErmeethLegendStudy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P809927818" "Circle of Thorns text"
// DetailString :
"P1917081382" "You found this book on the Circle of Thorns altar. As you skim through it, some passages catch your attention. One reads:<br><br>'Legends speak of Ermeeth, the ancient god of Oranbega, the bringer of magic. The legends say he will watch over those who follow the Circle eternally. If Ermeeth is real, it may be possible to contact him once more, using the blood of our greatest enemies for power.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P194494105" "You know the National Guild of Stage Magicians is holding its annual convention right here in Paragon City? I should have known that would be trouble. I just got a call from the convention chairman; some Circle of Thorns mystics broke in and made off with a handful of the attendees. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'm counting on you to rescue those magicians from the Circle of Thorns, {HeroName}.</A> I don't know what's in store for them, but I'm certain I don't want to find out."
// AcceptString :
"P4066736806" "Rescue the magicians from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P805039258" "This wasn't a random attack; according to the chairman, the Circle was very selective about their victims. Those people need to be rescued and whatever the Circle was planning for them needs to be stopped. You'll have stop any bizarre rituals the Circle may be performing on those magicians and rescue any magicians being held hostage."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3649603082" "Stop stage magician sacrifice"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P148033628" "If we leave those magicians in the Circle's hands, they'll probably be dead by morning! You have stop any bizarre rituals the Circle may be performing on those magicians and rescue any magicians being held hostage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3387819316" "The pleas of a terrified human voice go completely unanswered; eventually, they peter off into sobs."

