// Dialog :
"P1391453396" "So, old Warren Patterson sold his soul to a demon, huh? I guess that explains why every judge in Paragon City seemed to have gone soft in the noggin. But Warren reneged; he wouldn't surrender his soul. And the Circle came calling to collect. They probably hoped to gain the demon's allegiance by sacrificing Warren along with his entire staff. It probably would have worked, too."
// RandomFameString :
"P3044834986" "Did you hear {HeroName} saved an entire building from being sucked into hell?"

