// Dialog :
"P1747400019" "The Wyatts have been reunited, and they couldn't be more grateful. You did a great job on this one. Thanks to this book of names you recovered, we know the identities of many people the Circle no doubt planned to attack or recruit. I'll make sure that anyone in danger gets warning or protection from the Circle of Thorns. I hope they'll listen, but the allure of magic is a strong temptation for many in these desperate times. We'll just have to keep our eyes on them."
// RandomFameString :
"P1503535594" "I almost got taken by the Circle of Thorns, but I got a warning from {ContactName}! All I can say is, thank goodness for {HeroName}!"

