// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1277544615" "The Circle of Thorns have recently been increasing their numbers on the streets of Paragon City. With mystics and summoned fiends, they've been terrifying citizens everywhere. They have to constantly be confronted and defeated. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I would like to ask you to continue to battle the Circle of Thorns wherever they may be.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1944327305" "Hit the streets and defeat a few Circle of Thorns mystics"
// SendOffString :
"P338517085" "A great deal of recent activity has been occurring in Founders' Falls but anywhere you fight against them, your help would be welcomed."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2132417412" "Combat Circle of Thorns menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P988418539" "I need you to defeat some more Circle mystics."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1576844768" "You have fought enough of the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1446927623" "Great job dealing with those Circle of Thorns, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_CoT_Compound2.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_BUSINESS 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SeperationFromBody 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2909208859" "Ghost's body"
// DetailString :
"P2499285672" "This is the corpse of the ghostly student you encountered. There is no mark of violence upon it; it seems as if the boy's soul was simply wrenched from his body."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GhostStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3490421590" "Ghost's story"
// DetailString :
"P1297931842" "The apparition of Donald, the dead boy told you: <br><br>'...Robby had this...weird...thorn. <br>He stuck in it... into his heart... before any of us could stop, he stuck it right in his heart! ... and then... he wasn't Robby anymore. He talked different... smiled different... walked different... but he still seemed to know me... he asked if I'd like to be like him... powerful and free...I guess I... sort of nodded... he grabbed me and started whispering... magic words... I'd never heard before... And I was outside my body... He said when they were through with us, they'd try the Dewar Corporation next. That's where his dad works. <br><br>I think I have to go now... I think I have to go..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GreaterRitual 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3778157161" "Note"
// DetailString :
"P154607489" "This note bears the hastily scribbled fragments of many incantations. It says, 'The effect of the spell is still not certain. A larger test will be required. If all Founders' Falls can be severed from their bodies, it may be possible to do the same to all of Paragon City.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2972074443" "There's a group of people who I think may be in trouble. They were all in the Magic Society, a school sponsored club over at Paragon City University. When they started investigating the rituals of the Circle of Thorns, the chancellor disbanded the club, but I think he may not have been fast enough to stop the Circle from returning the students' interest. A source told me they're planning to perform some Circle rituals in a nearby clearing. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop the university students from performing the Circle's rituals.</A> I very much doubt they know what they're getting into."
// AcceptString :
"P1809011922" "Stop the university students from performing the Circle's rituals"
// SendOffString :
"P1549894217" "These are good kids, {HeroName}. They just need to be steered back to the straight and narrow. I've called in a few favors and had an emergency force field erected around the area. I hope I was fast enough to keep the Circle off their backs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_CoT_Compound2.1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

